+## OpenStorm .157 typed controller middleware guards
+
+Controller `$this->middleware('auth:guard')` strings share config-backed completion, hover, definitions, diagnostics and references only after the shared type engine confirms the receiver. Aliased/inherited/anonymous controllers and explicit closure-this bindings retain their identities; foreign receivers and unavailable static `$this` are excluded. Unsaved parent changes invalidate confirmed spans. Middleware completion replaces the full current guard segment in UTF-16 coordinates, preserves following guards and quotes, escapes inserted keys, and refuses encoded/interpolated or unbounded suffixes.
+
 ## OpenStorm .156 controller URL method completion
 
 Rooted controller URL literals complete public methods using their published runtime identity. Aliases, named argument roles and inherited methods share navigation's static helper guards; unresolved roots retain incomplete results. Completion replaces the entire method suffix without imports or call snippets, including Unicode PHP method names. Unsaved parent and helper changes refresh results without caller edits.
